OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA grey start to the day, with
OL,6,Fdense and extensive fog that will
OL,7,Fslowly dissipate during the morning.
OL,8,FBy the afternoon, sunny spells are
OL,9,Fexpected to develop. A light breeze,
OL,10,Fslightly windier along the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClear spells and light winds
OL,13,Fduring the evening will allow some
OL,14,Fmist or fog patches to form once more.
OL,15,FRain moves into northwestern parts by
OL,16,FSunday morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
