OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FRain and drizzle moving in
OL,6,Ffrom the northwest will linger for the
OL,7,Fbest part of the day, only clearing by
OL,8,Flate afternoon, when some bright
OL,9,Fspells are most likely.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA mix
OL,12,Fof sunny spells and cloudy periods,
OL,13,Fwith showers possible at times.
OL,14,FGenerally light winds. Temperatures
OL,15,Faround average for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
